Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.46,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Everyday Tale of Every Ashen Witch"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I am a witch and a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,My journey was a series\Nof meetings and farewells,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,and at the same time,\Nit was a series of choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I made many choices\Nthat I couldn't backtrack on,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and that has brought me to where I am today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:55.04,Main,,0,0,0,,"The Country That Makes Your Wishes Come True"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to be super rich. I want to be\Nsuper rich. I want to be super rich--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.21,0:01:59.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This is not what I wished for...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Mirarosé's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you a safe me? Or an evil me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "an evil me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are there two of me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,How much did those glasses cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The Ashen Witch, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the Ashen Witch, Elaina, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my wish to meet another me, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't ours, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,"Ours"? How many me's are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many there are\Nin total, but there are 15 of us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Fifteen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,--Tee-hee!\N--Oh, how nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh... I want to die...\N--Tee-hee!\N--Oh, how nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh... I want to die...\N--I can guess where everyone's\Nhidden their money...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--It's not like there's any hope.\N--I can guess where everyone's\Nhidden their money...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you. This is the 16th me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! You're cosplaying me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't really get doing it\Nwithout permission, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:54.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna charge you a usage fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ten billion gold coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,She gets excited about money,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,so she's not the "Ash" Witch,\Nshe's Excited Me, the "Cash" Witch, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The Cash Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoo! Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The one over there is the dumb me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hi, me number 16!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:15.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no one's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,She seems less dumb and more like a klutz...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the me who loves girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sixteen whole me's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so many of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Less like she likes girls,\Nand more like she likes herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This one has a strange complex\Nabout the size of her breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:46.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're supposed to be the same as me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.71,0:04:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,but for some reason, your chest\Nlooks deflated compared to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:56.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NHave you been drinking your milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Please wait! My chest--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,So pointless...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That me is kind of moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, my chest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--What're you looking at, bastard?\N--Oh, my chest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,--What're you looking at, bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight? Wanna fight? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Next to her is the greedy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If I take the money from all the\Nme's here, then I'll be super rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the usual me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the cringey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The black dragon thing imprisoned\Nin my eye is trying to attack all of you--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the love-struck maiden me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya, Saya...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Why Saya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The one hiding over there is me\Nwith a deep darkness in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:50.88,Main,,0,0,0,,And there's me with a deep\Ndarkness in my heart, number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:53.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate this... The outside is scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you traveling then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:06:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And me with a deep darkness\Nin my heart, number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:04.71,Main,,0,0,0,,All the me's here should just die...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I have too many deep darknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Over there is the me with a foreign affectation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}--Khorosho.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--Is this a show?\N{\i1}--Khorosho.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the gelatinous me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not even human anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the me that turned into a ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:28.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And I am the intellectual me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You think highly of yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:32.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the truth. And--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:37.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to call you something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What traits does the sixteenth me have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,--None! Tee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,--My cosplay! One hundred billion gold coins!\N--None! Tee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:45.63,Main,,0,0,0,,--My cosplay! One hundred billion gold coins!\N--She's got no personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,--No personality and no boobs.\N--She's got no personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,--No personality and no boobs.\N--No eyepatch or bandages...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,--No money.\N--No eyepatch or bandages...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,--No money.\N--Oh, 16 me's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wherefore art thou Saya...?\N--Oh, 16 me's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wherefore art thou Saya...?\N--I want to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,--Me, too...\N--I want to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Rest in peace...\N--Me, too...\N--I want to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Rest in peace...\N{\i1}--Khorosho.{\i0}\N{\i1}       {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:52.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I see, I see. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That was a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of help could that have been...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:07:01.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I'd like to call you "Protagonist Me."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What train of thought led you\Nto that incomprehensible name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:15.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I tried turning your weakness of\Nhaving no personality into a strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:18.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy to be told\NI have no personality, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, No Personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:23.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It means you can become anything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for a protagonist, No Personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,So, why are we all holed up in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,In this country, there's one\Nevil me mixed in with the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,She's violent and attacks\Nevery time she meets another me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a violent me, so we call her Violent Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like her description, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're holed up here to\Nrun away from that violent me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,But Violent Me is also me, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:03.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If you fought normally,\Nyou'd at least get a draw, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:07.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Protagonist Me, please think about it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If the opponent is also me,\Nthen that means I'd have to hurt myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine what would happen if she died?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we don't know, there's nothing we can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,so that's why we're gathered\Nhere to talk about it. Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Protagonist Me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,At a time like this, we need\Nthe protagonist to take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:49.58,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, my role is that of an\Nadviser who assists the protagonist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So, you led everyone to call me\NProtagonist Me so you could use me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What a schemer. As expected of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's how you feel, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, all the me's other than me\Nshould go investigate the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here and wait for\Nall the me's to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you saying, you little--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,--The protagonist should step down! Step down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, I'm so dignified...\N--The protagonist should step down! Step down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:30.75,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, I'm so dignified...\N--Is your brain smaller than a flea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,--You're lower than boobs!\N--Is your brain smaller than a flea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--How much will you give me?\N--You're lower than boobs!\N--Is your brain smaller than a flea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,--How much will you give me?\N--You're lower than boobs!\N--My right hand is about to go wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,--Saya...\N--My right hand is about to go wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Saya...\N--I want to go to heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--I want to go... back inside my mother...\N--Saya...\N--I want to go to heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--I want to go... back inside my mother...\N--The messenger of hell isn't coming for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--The messenger of hell isn't coming for me...\N--You said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What? You're the ones who put me\Nup on a pedestal as the protagonist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I'm so selfish. In that case, tell me--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Ghoul Me died!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really grotesque!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It was definitely an instant death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:58.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Gel Me has also been crushed\Nand is in a gelatinous state!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:05.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're alive. Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:08.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they're okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You people were gathered here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that me is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:20.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Violent Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I will dispose of every single last me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the me sitting on the throne over\Nthere the leader of all the me's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:38.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'm the leader or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm called Protagonist Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I see, I see. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the protagonist?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Please die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:11:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why in the world you're\Nso upset that you would attack me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,but are you saying you can beat 16 me's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gel Me and Ghoul Me\Nare down, so there are 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you can beat 14 me's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't live in a carefree world\Nlike the ones you all live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--Could it be that you've never\Nlooked in a mirror before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--Sneak... Sneak...\N--Could it be that you've never\Nlooked in a mirror before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you're also a me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my big boobs...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Scary, scary, scary, scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't come closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go home now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Into the darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It was a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like we're about to be executed...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want to return to the earth like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nice and cool and calming...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I made a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Not this money...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not going to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I was watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that you're not\Nan opponent I can't beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,How impertinent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, the same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is your hair still short?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You know why my hair was cut off, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:07.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Because my hair was\Nalso cut off in that country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't have the energy to\Nput my hair back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save a single\Nperson in that country...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen the instant love\Nturns to hate with your own eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The instant when someone turns to a person\Nthey just loved with murderous intent?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And? Was your hair cut by the Ripper after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Your journey was a very different one from mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Different...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, different. Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm different from you all, as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:09.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you saw the moment love turns to hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,With just that, did you lose\Nthe energy to get your hair back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and enter a state of despair?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I really didn't wish for\Nanything like this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:34.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't despair. I seethed with anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? At what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,At myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,At the me's who kept\Ntraveling carefree, unlike me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,and at myself, who couldn't do anything\Neven when faced with cruel reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,She's really taking her anger out on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You should...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You should just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you saying that to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,To me? Or to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:55.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This country is supposed\Nto make wishes come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive the me's who traveled\Ncarefree without knowing any pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure that's why I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,To make the other me's experience\Nthe same thing as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's your wish, not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, why are we all gathered here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:18.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't know? Or are you\Npretending not to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:22.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We threw our magic at each\Nother with everything we had,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,but unfortunately, we were so evenly matched
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,that in the end, even after\Nwe'd both used up all our magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:33.29,Main,,0,0,0,,nothing was settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Why in the world did I come to this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,First, let me tell you what I was\Nkind of wishing deep inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:17:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I came here to meet the other me's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I was probably dying\Nto see the other possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,"Other possibilities"...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Journeys are a series of meetings and farewells,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and at the same time,\Nthey are a series of choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:19.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I might've had some other choices...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:22.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Possibilities other than me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I came here and\Nmet the other versions of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't explain why {\i1}I'm {\i0}here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you also felt a yearning\Nfor the other me's, like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,A yearning for a me that wasn't\Ncaught up in the middle of the sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,at the Clock Village of Rostolf\Nis what led you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You probably came here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:58.17,Main,,0,0,0,,wishing for a version of yourself that\Nhadn't experienced all that sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:03.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Not in order to hurt us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,but to heal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That's self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say "self-centered"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no one here but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you listen to my story?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,About how I went back in\Ntime ten years in that country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I came here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:41.67,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I made peace with myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,and we talked until dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,When we went back to the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,we shared our diaries,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,and took turns reading about all our travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:19:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I've thought of something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Something good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We wrote in our diaries in order\Nto tell Mom about our travels,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,but do you want to turn\Nthis into a book someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,A book?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Like {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0}--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,No, a story about our travels that\Nwill surpass {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of Protagonist Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in! I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,A book about our dark past... Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Khorosho!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do about the title then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,"The Adventures of Elaina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like Niké, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,"Let's Go, Elaina!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,"Blooming Lily Elaina."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,"You Can Have Big Boobs, Too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,"How to Glare Properly."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"How to Make One Trillion Gold Coins."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:56.79,Main,,0,0,0,,"Elaina's Dream Diary."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,"The Days of Saya and My Love."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,"Elaina: Hell Part."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"Elaina: Stairway to Heaven."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,"Happiest at Home."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:06.88,Main,,0,0,0,,"Khorosho!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, will all the me's please\Nthink about this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.25,0:20:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, after intense discussion,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,the name of the book was finally decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:26.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Khorosho...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you plan on doing after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I'll try and get my hair back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:42.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's probably still on the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:47.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Well, the culprit's\Nalready been caught, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,so I should be good once I find the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You're welcome, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.33,0:21:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:25.58,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Wandering Witch"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, shall I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:44.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And now, a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:50.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's the witch flying\Nthrough the clear blue sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,so beautiful that if someone were there,\Nthey would definitely look back and sigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the person traveling and writing\Nmy--our--story, Wandering Witch--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:24.58,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Wandering Witch"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! I was caught up in my writing--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I should've paid more attention, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,But you should look at your\Nsurroundings when you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're just making your\Nown field of vision smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.67,0:23:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.25,0:23:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's both be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:32.83,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Wandering Witch"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:46.54,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Read This When You Wake Up in the Morning"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know yet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,that she and I would be\Ntraveling together in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Her name is Amnesia.
